-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">34</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/08/bong-ue-tapangtfuya.html\">Tapangʉ、Tfuya紀行</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 林承翰</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">36</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/08/bong-ue-e.html\">萬能ê門口埕</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 李楠崇</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">38</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/08/bong-ue.html\">繁華大稻埕</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 施玉鳳</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">Sann-kap讀小說</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">40</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/08/sann-kap-ka-choah_0854771723.html\">Ka-choa̍h人（五）</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 杜信龍</div>\n                        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 40px;\">\n        <div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj1ZnF97ckid515MwuGXsatoXRLB3X8MNtRLaqrT9iJJP3KYhdz0qccFK4irxuhyjaYLco_fHZSe3xvQnkeXkNKipB7vlJJPYuDu9QKA9-26cJHv5QILEBKNx3IEr0BE8FBDERcj3bBIxxHwD7GdMk14wJhUH-VGhqrXGyXG7zmFf_txAwEvMSjZUOlLAvw\" style=\"border-radius: 4px; height: auto; width: 100%;\" /></div>\n        <div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiPtjjaKK75hPDmBiOYZY0Ny5_VVAbEsm9jjxFpl0o22DNd4T54y0uNwP6mGqRcago4mwHw7sDby0sOlKgqExPiaRa3x45bfUEva4vT5LZEwXDOSQXyQnfl79EPgDoBmv1-OjCiVwlqdGnZ6kizd5JUxLSQCc-rGPJjYeRwu8GMzdGUePxmYr_HKdpqQaQa\" style=\"border-radius: 4px; height: auto; width: 100%;\" /></div>\n        <div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgcaJA6N1ZrqgmRUKUpwRw_bfFGnWPXE-oN4zAE4h4X2M64Aed3YCoqI1GA9YW53DORyrqM-REyDAMwEw82xn7QZcPCJs4Lywf0ZbrOVcFMVSHNVJPpN1ttnKE3Dmr-sydbgQFcHB67mwVOPp_mioP1mq3U0EWv-41HqZyvzNWeXu7LTU1dImdfZD8ZeE-K\" style=\"border-radius: 4px; height: auto; width: 100%;\" /></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"donation-section\" style=\"background-color: #fcfcfc; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); margin-top: 20px; overflow: hidden;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; padding: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n            <div style=\"font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n                <b><span style=\"color: #3778cd;\">#台文通訊BONG報</span> 389期，2026年08月出刊。</b>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會</div>\n            <div style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 16px;\">\n                線上捐款(定期定額) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a><br />\n                線上捐款(單筆) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 15px;\">\n                郵政劃撥：19021486 / 戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會<br />\n                電匯：123-20-050514-2 (華南銀行士林分行)\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; color: #050505; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 15px; text-align: justify;\">\n                #李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>"
